Summary of the Job Description
As an integral member of our delivery team, the Business Intelligence (BI) Developer is responsible for the design, development, implementation, management and support of missioncritical enterprise BI reporting and Extract, Transform, Load (ETL) processes and environments.
Working with crossfunctional teams, you will be required to gather, document, and approve business requirements for data analysis and reporting projects, as well as use BI and database tools to develop reporting solutions to meet all business needs.
Using your skills and experience as a BI Developer, you will design, develop and implement ETL processes to transform structured, unstructured and disparate source data into the target data store(s)/ data warehouse(s) / data mart(s).
Responsibilities
