He/She will in addition be involved in the following:
Formulating and implementing government policies to achieve the objectives of the Council in the sugar sector;
Advise Council on dynamic changes in the global sugar industry;
Formulate, execute, coordinate and monitor Council’s projects;
Liaise with relevant MDAs, States and Local Governments on land acquisition and provision of infrastructures as well as financial institutions to facilitate availability of loan-able funds to investors;
